>included with NT? Are they supported iwth the video card? etc, etc...

Windows NT includes OpenGL. Do you want to port to Win32 (in which case you 
need nothing but VC++), or do you still want to use X (in which case you'll 
need an X library like eXcursion) as well as VC++.

OpenL is supported no matter what the video card. It may work faster on cards 
with explicit hardware support, but that won't stop you from developing on a 
VGA display. 8-)
