As it turns out, the solution was simple (no thanks to the
ambiguity in the network access software documentation)

On the DECserver, I had to:

   DEFINE PORT 1-15 IPCP ADDRESS ENABLED

which allows address negotiation (the default is DISABLED)
but the doc isn't clear about this so I gambled with it
(50/50 chance) and it worked.

Then, as you say, just click on "Server" in "Obtain Address"
and away you go...

Curt




