references: <1995Nov6.080529.652@flying-disk.com> <47m24j$d6n@hermes.oc.com> <1995Nov7.092658.659@flying-disk.com> <x3lopsf5c5.fsf@avante.WPI.EDU> <47osk6$rvg@itnews.sc.intel.com> <danpop.815950124@rscernix> <DHvvs4.172@mv.mv.com> <487m4v$sdf@topaz.sensor.com>
