configure the NIS600 as a MOP proxy load host to download the software
for the WANrouter.

The real load host is an alpha2100 running OSF3.2C and DNA320, connected
on the same lan (L601 card) with the DECnis.

When i boot the WANrouter, the DECnis receives a MOP request on its serial
link for the system software and forwards it correctly to the real load
host. The real load host then sends the file (vr1011.sys) to the DECnis 
which download it to the wanrouter.
