|>every time it runs the machine is full of swap activity (no one else can work).

That is the GEM-based DEC C compiler, which is compatible with DEC C on other
Digital platforms and uses the same optimizer/code-generator as most other
Digital compilers.  The compiler you get when you don't use -migrate is based
on the old MIPS C compiler.
